      {
        "id": "experience-ffa",
        "html": "<div class=\"project-body creator-project-intro\"><div class=\"project-copy\"><p data-i18n=\"journeyffaType\" class=\"micro\">PRODUCT / COMMERCE</p><h3 id=\"experience-ffa-title\"><img class=\"project-identity\" src=\"assets/hero-tools/ffa.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">FFA</h3><p class=\"project-description\" data-i18n=\"experience-ffaIntro\">Connecting product priorities, commerce platforms and B2B operations.</p></div><div class=\"project-context\"><p class=\"journey-date\">2025 — <span data-i18n=\"present\">Present</span></p><p class=\"journey-role\"><span data-i18n=\"experienceFFA\">Product Owner · E-Commerce &amp; B2B</span></p></div></div><div class=\"journey-highlights\" aria-label=\"Focus / Domaines\"><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M4 10h16M10 10v10\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-ffaFocus0\">Product ownership</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"17\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"17\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5M5 17v-5h14v5\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-ffaFocus1\">Connected commerce</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/><path d=\"M20 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-ffaFocus2\">Delivery</strong></div></div><details class=\"project-story\" id=\"experience-ffa-details\"><summary><span data-i18n=\"journeyDetails\">Role &amp; responsibilities</span><span class=\"summary-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"case-content\"><p data-i18n=\"missionFFAText\">Platform discovery and backlog ownership; cross-functional delivery of the Shopify Plus rebuild, ERP integration, marketplace onboarding and logistics automation.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#ffa-title\"><span data-i18n=\"journeyFFAProject\">Explore the FFA project</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></details>",
        "label": "FFA"
      },
      {
        "id": "experience-sit",
        "html": "<div class=\"project-body creator-project-intro\"><div class=\"project-copy\"><p data-i18n=\"journeysitType\" class=\"micro\">QUALITY / PROCESS</p><h3 id=\"experience-sit-title\">SIT Group</h3><p class=\"project-description\" data-i18n=\"experience-sitIntro\">Turning operational feedback into clearer processes and continuous improvement.</p></div><div class=\"project-context\"><p class=\"journey-date\">2023 — 2025</p><p class=\"journey-role\"><span data-i18n=\"experienceQuality\">Quality &amp; Process Optimisation</span></p></div></div><div class=\"journey-highlights\" aria-label=\"Focus / Domaines\"><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"15\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 6h9v5m-3-3 3 3 3-3M15 18H6v-5m-3 3 3-3 3 3\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-sitFocus0\">Process mapping</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"m15 15 6 6M7 10h6M10 7v6\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-sitFocus1\">Root-cause analysis</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 7a9 9 0 0 0-15-2L2 8m0-6v6h6M4 17a9 9 0 0 0 15 2l3-3m0 6v-6h-6\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-sitFocus2\">Lean</strong></div></div><details class=\"project-story\" id=\"experience-sit-details\"><summary><span data-i18n=\"journeyDetails\">Role &amp; responsibilities</span><span class=\"summary-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"case-content\"><p data-i18n=\"missionSITText\">Feedback loops and root-cause analysis translated operational friction into improvement requirements, with process mapping and Lean methods to reduce waste and lead times.</p></div></details>",
        "label": "SIT Group"
      },
      {
