      {
        "id": "experience-alliances",
        "html": "<div class=\"project-body creator-project-intro\"><div class=\"project-copy\"><p data-i18n=\"journeyalliancesType\" class=\"micro\">EARLY EXPERIENCE / SYSTEM AUDIT</p><h3 id=\"experience-alliances-title\">ALLIANCES</h3><p class=\"project-description\" data-i18n=\"experience-alliancesIntro\">Assessing information-system security and prioritising remediation.</p></div><div class=\"project-context\"><p class=\"journey-date\"><span data-i18n=\"journeyEarly\">Early professional experience</span></p><p class=\"journey-role\"><span data-i18n=\"journeyalliancesRole\">Information-system audit</span></p></div></div><div class=\"journey-highlights\" aria-label=\"Focus / Domaines\"><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 21v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m3 10v-2a6 6 0 0 0-3-5\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-alliancesFocus0\">Security assessment</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"m15 15 6 6M7 10h6M10 7v6\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-alliancesFocus1\">ISO 27001 gap analysis</strong></div><div><span class=\"journey-focus-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"15\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 6h9v5m-3-3 3 3 3-3M15 18H6v-5m-3 3 3-3 3 3\"/></svg></span><strong data-i18n=\"experience-alliancesFocus2\">Remediation roadmap</strong></div></div><details class=\"project-story\" id=\"experience-alliances-details\"><summary><span data-i18n=\"journeyDetails\">Role &amp; responsibilities</span><span class=\"summary-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"case-content\"><p data-i18n=\"missionAlliancesText\">Organisational and technical security assessment, ISO 27001 gap analysis and a progressive remediation roadmap.</p></div></details>",
        "label": "ALLIANCES"
      },
      {
        "id": "experience-tgr",
